      "observed": "On the DISPLAY sheet the SSD1306 interface-select pins BS0 (pin 10), BS1 (pin 11) and BS2 (pin 12) of U4 are wired to the VCC/GND symbols in a pattern that does not correspond to BS2,BS1,BS0 = 0,1,0 (BS0 appears tied to VCC rather than GND).",
